Let's nail this promo in one go!",0,""],["w",0.5],["trn",0,0,true,false,1.0],["w",1.0],["bg","guard_outside_daylight",0,0.5],["w",0.5],["stg",0,0.0,null,null,"Linear",0.0,null,null,null],["se","se_076"],["trn",1,0,false,false,1.0],["w",2.0],["se","se_095"],["show","avg1_107","e","015",0.5,null,null,0,null,0.0],["ctl","avg1_107","e",null,null,null,null,null,1.0,"niunie1","Linear",0.5],["say","avg1_107","She was all raring to go before the filming actually started. However...",0,""],["w",0.5],["bg","mood_4",0,0.5],["ctl","avg1_107","e","007","awkward",null,null,null,null,null,"Linear",0.5],["say","avg1_107","Sigh... How did it come to this...",0,""],["w",0.5],["bg","guard_outside_daylight",0,0.5],["w",0.5],["se","se_077"],["stg",0,null,-30.0,1.05,"Linear",0.5,null,null,null],["mrt",1,"z","022",null,null],["say","avg3_100","You've worked hard. Here, have some water.",1,""],["mrt",3,"z",null,null,null],["w",0.5],["bgm","m9"],["se","se_186"],["ctl","avg1_107","e","005",null,null,null,null,null,"lengzhan","Linear",0.5],["say","avg1_107","I'm sorry... I just wasted everyone's time. The seniors went out of their ways to get me this chance, and I still messed it up...",0,""],["w",0.5],["stg",0,80.0,null,null,"Linear",0.5,null,null,null],["w",0.5],["show","avg3_189","a","002",0.25,null,null,0,null,0.0],["ctl","avg1_107","e",null,null,0.65,null,null,null,null,"Linear",0.5],["ctl","avg3_189","a","009","sweaty",0.3,null,null,1.0,null,"Linear",0.5],["say","avg3_189","It's not your fault. They didn't even give you any time to get used to the camera. They only told you about the shoot last night! That's like setting you up to fail.",0,""],["w",0.5],["mrt",1,"z","002","attention",null],["say","avg3_100","Last night? Seriously?",1,""],["mrt",3,"z",null,null,null],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg1_107","e",null,null,0.7,null,null,0.0,null,"Linear",0.5],["se","se_074"],["ctl","avg3_189","a","010",null,0.45,null,null,null,null,"Linear",0.5],["say","avg3_189","Yeah. The higher-ups suddenly decided they wanted a promo video, but none of the knights wanted the job. Especially not the lead role.",0,""],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg3_189","a","005","awkward",null,null,null,null,"chijing","Linear",0.5],["say","avg3_189","You know the Guard's reputation out there... No one wants to show their face in the video and become a laughingstock.",0,""],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg3_189","a","008","sigh",null,null,null,null,null,"Linear",0.5],["say","avg3_189","So they kept passing it around like a hot potato until it landed on Tilia. She spent the whole night memorizing her lines.",0,""],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg3_189","a","009",null,null,null,null,null,"chijing","Linear",0.5],["say","avg3_189","If you ask me, none of the knights here actually care about the job. They're all just doing the bare minimum to hand something in to their superiors. Tilia's the only one taking it seriously.",0,""],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg3_189","a",null,null,0.3,null,null,null,null,"Linear",0.5],["se","se_062"],["ctl","avg1_107","e",null,null,0.6,null,null,1.0,null,"Linear",0.5],["say","avg1_107","I get what you mean, Kay. It's true that the Imperial Guard's public image is not great these days...",0,""],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg1_107","e","003",null,null,null,null,null,"niunie1","Linear",0.5],["say","avg1_107","But once we put on a cool, inspiring video, maybe people would start to see the Guard differently.==W== That's why I really want to show the world what an Imperial Knight should be!",0,""],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg1_107","e","011","exclamation",null,null,null,1.0,"JuGong1","OutSine",0.5],["goon"],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg3_189","a","008","sigh",null,null,null,null,null,"Linear",0.5],["say","avg3_189","Hmm, I knew you'd say that. Since you're trying so hard, I can't just leave you to struggle alone.",0,""],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg3_189","a","004","question",null,null,null,null,null,"Linear",0.5],["say","avg3_189","So what now? With your poor acting, you can hardly expect people to get what a proper Imperial Knight is supposed to look like.",0,""],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg3_189","a",null,null,null,null,null,0.0,null,"Linear",0.5],["w",0.5],["se","se_095"],["bg","mood_3",0,0.5],["ctl","avg1_107","e","015",null,0.45,null,null,null,null,"Linear",0.5],["say","avg1_107","Ugh...==W== I don't know why, but the second I face the camera, my mind just blanks. All the lines I memorized go \"poof\"...",0,""],["w",1],["ctl","avg1_107","e","005","flurry",null,null,null,null,"niunie1","Linear",0.5],["goon"],["w",0.5],["mrt",1,"z","014","idea",null],["say","avg3_100","Maybe it's time for a different approach?",1,""],["mrt",3,"z",null,null,null],["w",0.5],["bg","guard_outside_daylight",0,0.5],["ctl","avg1_107","e","002","attention",null,-0.35,1.5,null,"jushou2","Linear",0.3],["say","avg1_107","You have something in mind, Boss?",0,""],["w",0.5],["mrt",1,"z","020",null,null],["say","avg3_100","A friend of mine in Flavio once said, people freeze up in front of cameras because they're thinking too much about acting.",1,""],["mrt",0,"z","009",null,null],["say","avg3_100","But the more you try to \"act,\" the more awkward it looks.",1,""],["mrt",0,"z","004","music",null],["say","avg3_100","So, instead of thinking about \"acting,\" you should try to become the role itself.",1,""],["mrt",3,"z",null,null,null],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg1_107","e","016","question",null,null,null,null,null,"Linear",0.5],["say","avg1_107","\"Become the role itself\"?",0,""],["w",0.5],["mrt",1,"z","002",null,null],["say","avg3_100","Tilia, in your eyes, who's the coolest, most inspiring knight?",1,""],["mrt",3,"z",null,null,null],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg1_107","e","017","star",null,null,null,null,"jushou2","Linear",0.5],["say","avg1_107","The Masked Knight, of course!",0,""],["w",0.5],["mrt",1,"z","003","speechless",null],["say","avg3_100","Then try to imagine that you are the Masked Knight. As the Masked Knight, what would you say to others? What would you want them to feel?",1,""],["mrt",3,"z",null,null,null],["w",0.5],["se","se_075"],["ctl","avg1_107","e",null,null,null,0.0,1.0,null,null,"Linear",0.3],["w",0.3],["ctl","avg1_107","e","018",null,null,null,null,1.0,"niunie1","OutSine",0.5],["say","avg1_107","I'm Masked Knight... Hmm...",0,""],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg1_107","e",null,null,null,null,null,0.0,null,"Linear",0.505],["hide","avg1_107",0.505],["w",0.505],["bg","BG_Black",5,0.0],["show","avg1_107","e","018",null,-0.15,1.2,5,null,1.0],["stage",5,0,0],["bgm",""],["ctl","avg1_107","e",null,"speechless",null,null,null,null,null,"Linear",1.5],["w",1.5],["bg","mood_2",5,0.5],["ctl","avg1_107","e","010","exclamation",null,null,null,null,"JuGong2","Linear",0.5],["say","avg1_107","If I were the Masked Knight...!",0,""],["w",0.5],["end"]]}